  "title": "037-你真需要几万元的自行车吗？骑行的门槛其实不高",
  "source_url": "https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68cf82d92c82c9dcca6b3fc2",
  "source_kind": "public-page",
  "fetched_at": "2026-07-30T01:57:55.081837+00:00",
  "shownotes_html": "<p><span>这期我请来了老朋友大山。对他来说，人生的节点可以被一辆车标记：从小学的小轮车，到铁三用的 TT 车，再到如今能随手折叠的通勤“小玩具”。我原本把自行车当成“越便宜越安心的代步工具”，直到参加铁三、借了大山的车，才知道骑行的张力来自“人×装备×风景×文化”的叠加。我们聊了环法的历史传承和规则战术，也把北京周边三条实用的进阶路线说清楚：戒台寺、潭王路、妙峰山；还谈到国内赛事里那些容易被忽略的安全意识。随着聊天的深入，我意识到：骑行真正的门槛不是预算，而是你愿不愿意把车推入风中。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgGTkeTaP1Ve998unP6shN_uvAK6.png\"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong><span>大山（前期节目：</span><a href=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6790e129a2c8d144a7d086ef?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxZjQyMGM4MmNiZDdjMDE3NjYyZjNmZSJ9\" data-url=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6790e129a2c8d144a7d086ef?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxZjQyMGM4MmNiZDdjMDE3NjYyZjNmZSJ9\"><span>环京旅行</span></a><span>、</span><a href=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67bd7a94606e5c5940b8b031?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxZjQyMGM4MmNiZDdjMDE3NjYyZjNmZSJ9\" data-url=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67bd7a94606e5c5940b8b031?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxZjQyMGM4MmNiZDdjMDE3NjYyZjNmZSJ9\"><span>欧洲旅行</span></a><span>、</span><a href=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680e11c68aed253fa3d0d58a?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxZjQyMGM4MmNiZDdjMDE3NjYyZjNmZSJ9\" data-url=\"https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680e11c68aed253fa3d0d58a?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxZjQyMGM4MmNiZDdjMDE3NjYyZjNmZSJ9\"><span>养鱼</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong><span>羊行</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>录制日期：</span></strong><span>2025年7月31日</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>发布日期：</span></strong><span>2025年9月22日</span></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrBQtdC8YIIr0BIq09IGIMsSq42_.png\"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"57\">00:57</a> 大山回顾自己从小学到现在的六辆车</span><br><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"328\">05:28</a> 自行车热潮与装备升级</span><br><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"393\">06:33</a> TT 赛车与“超跑”比喻</span><br><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"495\">08:15</a> 从装备到人：骑行的核心</span><br><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"581\">09:41</a> 北京骑行爱好者的集结地</span><br><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"679\">11:19</a> 羊行的自行车通勤体验</span><br><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"803\">13:23</a> 为什么追求轻快的车？</span><br><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"888\">14:48</a> 骑行文化与环法赛事</span><br><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"978\">16:18</a> 环法赛程与赛事规模</span></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlrAt_tWZsl0hmWGLWPierZjRBT1.jpg\"></figure><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp6G17D3t1L11AyYUhmE13l93Lb3.jpg\"></figure><span></span><p><br><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1082\">18:02</a> UCI与自行车规则</span><br><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1233\">20:33</a> 环法、环意、环西：三大赛事实力</span></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgPBpRgwqQU0ZS6AKuZrmIeP4594.jpg\"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1406\">23:26</a> 喜德盛车队与中国元素</span></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvDf-JyBS3l5ZWeHy3EwIBOgGgWc.jpg\"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1521\">25:21</a> 风拽效应与团队战术</span><br><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1641\">27:21</a> 荣誉衫的历史与意义</span></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsR5CfQV3gk31EUasH5oVrqFVLEg.jpg\"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1828\">30:28</a> 突围集团与战术心机</span></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtyH4323V-vDm8z7cxCF4aebES1L.jpg\"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1949\">32:29</a> 中国的顶级赛事——环广西</span></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo5BOZ6XoOLqEMUCjT-krO_lK3Ik.jpg\"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2084\">34:44</a> 自行车比赛也是风光片</span></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmb9RXsmKvkVpnSgmTQO0Nbhv6_k.jpg\"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2220\">37:00</a> 环法的地理路线设计</span></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjN6bQ4K_swzZdTdBYbGM6nLeVqW.jpg\"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2422\">40:22</a> 自行车赛事与文旅结合</span></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FukDylYreXOu52YsCYZNfqM6e4jb.jpg\"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2637\">43:57</a> 国内赛事的安全与门槛</span><br><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2852\">47:32</a> 北京周边三条推荐骑行路线</span></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsNQPUvrPds1XM1hO4qQlTZTrhFc.jpg\"></figure><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FogqvjQwkCFVJE06VX2eW-zi3J7T.jpg\"></figure><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvgUEzgn2SDwvMzmrh44l0p-r3iu.jpg\"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3326\">55:26</a> 骑行的风险与安全提示</span><br><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3583\">59:43</a> 如何拥有你的第一辆车</span><br><span><a class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3689\">01:01:29</a> 自行车产业的长期价值</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>以上图片来源见水印，无水印图由嘉宾提供</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqt82iNKdqSsw5FxVqZxAT_hkC-s.png\"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>TT车（计时赛车）</span></strong><span>：为追求速度和空气动力学设计的自行车，常用于铁人三项或计时赛，外形像“超跑”。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>公路大组赛</span></strong><span>：最普及的职业自行车比赛形式，骑手成群结队在公路上比拼。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>突围集团（Breakaway）</span></strong><span>：少数车手主动加速“逃走”；可能为赛段胜利，也可能为小车队争曝光。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>风拽效应（破风）</span></strong><span>：前方车手抵挡风阻，后方车手可借此省力，是团队战术的核心。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>荣誉衫</span></strong><span>：环法的标志性战衣，包括黄色领骑衫（总成绩领先）、绿色衫（冲刺王）、圆点衫（爬坡王）、白色衫（最佳年轻车手）。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>HC级爬坡</span></strong><span>：超越一级难度的爬坡等级，常见于阿尔卑斯或比利牛斯等顶级赛段。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>环广西</span></strong><span>：中国大陆唯一的 UCI 世界巡回赛级别赛事，顶级车队必须参赛。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>4+2 出行</span></strong><span>：四个汽车轮子＋两个车轮；把车带到更友好的起终点，提升骑行质量与安全边际。</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>City Riding</span></strong><span>：城市骑行的一种生活方式，融合通勤、休闲和轻健身。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FodNsZVS7p-N1z0DqLt4kZ3UkR03.png\"></p><span></span><p><strong><span>配乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Kraftwerk - Tour de France</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>后期：西红是番茄</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>订阅《苦中找乐》：</span></strong><span>你能想到的平台都可以找到并订阅。</span></p>",
